### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect the longest-running workqueue item and controller logs. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
A blocked dependency or a reconciliation operation that does not complete.

### Fix
Resolve the blocked dependency and confirm the controller can process subsequent items.

### Verify
Longest-running workqueue processing time returns below the threshold. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
